    {
      "effects": [],
      "flags": {
        "pf2e-creature-crispr": {
          "abilityBenchmarks": {
            "descriptionTemplate": "<p>The kobolds hastily prepare a handful of rudimentary traps in their vicinity until the beginning of their next turn. The next creature who moves adjacent to the trap squad triggers a trap and must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:{2}] save. On a failure, the creature takes @Damage[{0}[persistent,bleed]] damage (@Damage[{1}[persistent,bleed]] damage on a critical failure). A creature taking persistent bleed damage from Hasty Traps takes a –5-foot enhancement penalty to its Speed. This occurs to as many creatures as the kobold trap squad has segments when it performed the action, but a single creature can trigger only one trap per turn.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.JUo3BTRaRHkL9ZBC]{Effect: Hasty Traps}</p>",
            "originalDescription": "<p>The kobolds hastily prepare a handful of rudimentary traps in their vicinity until the beginning of their next turn. The next creature who moves adjacent to the trap squad triggers a trap and must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:18] save. On a failure, the creature takes @Damage[1d4[persistent,bleed]] damage (@Damage[2d4[persistent,bleed]] damage on a critical failure). A creature taking persistent bleed damage from Hasty Traps takes a –5-foot enhancement penalty to its Speed. This occurs to as many creatures as the kobold trap squad has segments when it performed the action, but a single creature can trigger only one trap per turn.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.JUo3BTRaRHkL9ZBC]{Effect: Hasty Traps}</p>",
